+
+| | repository | start | end | branch |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| MS | `arXiv-v1-polished-extended-preprint` | `e0b130e1771949623dcc5d27cee7958d1b9cd5cd` | `ab18213d74c867af5327f805c7dbabf50baec132` | `upgrade/remote-2026-09-11` (new; `main` untouched) |
